  "content": "<p><span><span><span>它會移除玻璃上的接縫和斑點。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>它不需要 Optifine、Continuity 或其他模組即可運作。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cx6qsrp/2024-03-19-232956.png\" alt=\"Stained glass in a building\" width=\"1448\" height=\"1220\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>玻璃板的接縫也會變得不那麼明亮：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3k5FSrG/2024-03-20-133105.png\" alt=\"Glass pane\" width=\"1084\" height=\"763\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>普通玻璃和染色玻璃將保持不變：</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qk6hzcg/2024-03-20-133338.png\" alt=\"Ordinary glass and tinted glass\" width=\"1852\" height=\"1017\"></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>",
